      "contributor_id": "54d2a843-200b-4a8f-b1d0-6fe280d1e527",
      "kind": "story",
      "transcript": "Nora is Rosa’s sister. She taught Rosa to cook when they were girls. They still argued lovingly about how much lemon belonged in the cake.",
